  "data.item_model": {"zh":"`data` 内的 `item_model` 仅设置组件值，**不会生成模型**。要关联模型定义并触发生成，请在物品根级配置。","en":"`item_model` inside `data` only sets the component value and **does not generate models**. To link to a model definition and trigger model generation, configure it at the item root level instead."},
  "data.profile": {"zh":"设置玩家头颅皮肤。支持字符串（自动检测为名称、URL 或 base64）或 map 形式。","en":"Sets a player head skin. Accepts strings (auto-detected as name, URL, or base64) or a map."},
